storm. Defend yourself in an abyssal arena or die trying. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced action</strong><i>\u00a0</i>\u2013\u00a0Display combat prowess and moment to moment decision making or face certain doom. You will be challenged by relentless enemies who will not give you an inch of breathing room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Develop an arsenal<i>\u00a0</i></strong>\u2013\u00a0Collect powerful items and upgrades along the way to gain your advantage. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355770/extras/d6e73e836815d6b5fa3d68b712547ea9.poster.avif?t=1748095433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355770/extras/d6e73e836815d6b5fa3d68b712547ea9.webm?t=1748095433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1355770/extras/d6e73e836815d6b5fa3d68b712547ea9.mp4?t=1748095433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Roguelike gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every run is different and small decisions will have large impacts on your success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 enemies</strong> \u2013 Each acting filling a unique 'chess piece' role in the ring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>50+ items</strong> \u2013 Arm yourself with the equipment of heroes fallen before you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless waves</strong> \u2013 Increasingly difficult challenges to survive through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>A true challenge.</strong><br></p></li></ul>",
